---
title: Waffles
author: Mary Arntson
category: Good Morning, Morning Glory!
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@eggs{3%beaten}
@buttermilk{1.5%cups}
@oil{0.5%cup}
@flour{1.5%cups}
@baking soda{1%tsp}
@baking powder{2%tsp}
@salt{0.5%tsp}
@vanilla{1%tsp}

Mix well. Can also use as pancake mix.
